// No database in this project.
// State is stored in a single JSON file: agent/data/state.json
// See models/schemas.py for the full data model (Pydantic).
//
// Top-level structure:
//   AppState
//   ├── user: User (profile, phase, calendar config)
//   ├── goal: Goal (fitness goal, preferences, constraints)
//   ├── schedule_context: ScheduleContext (sleep, routine blocks, preferred times)
//   ├── planned_sessions: [PlannedSession] (each linked to a Google Calendar event)
//   └── conversation_logs: [ConversationLog] (summaries of each conversation)
//
// If persistence beyond JSON is added later (e.g. SQLite, Postgres), this file should be updated.
